        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Used treadmills are easy to find and worth buying carefully.</strong>
            Local marketplaces are cheapest, used fitness stores add servicing and a short warranty,
            and gym liquidations offer commercial hardware. Wherever you buy, see it running, plan
            the move first, and never pay a deposit sight unseen.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Run the
            <a href="/used-treadmill-buying-checklist/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">used treadmill checklist</a>
